/*  EXPECTED: REJECTED at type-check, identically by both backends.

    Written to attack the store rules (2026-11-17 review): map entry through lookup. A rabbit's series reaches
    something that outlives the rabbit (docs/SOUNDNESS.md, obligation O2). */

Define shelves as a map from text to series of series of number.
In shelves, the entry for "a" becomes a series of series of number.
Pull a rabbit.
    Define inner as a series of number with (1, 2, 3).
    Define shelf as (the entry for "a" in shelves) but void is (a series of series of number).
    Insert inner into shelf.
Done.

Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State (the entry for "a" in shelves) but void is (a series of series of number).
